  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting social rights and responsibilities in urban communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will promote and protect  rights of women and children, and support them to advocate directly for their  rights. It will support target schools to provide quality and accessible education in safe learning environment free from the influence of alcohol and drugs. It will  improve health standards that will reduce illness and death among  women and children in poor and marginalised areas, and support youth employment through training, placements and support for self-employment.</narrative>
  </description>
